---
// src/components/about/AboutHero.astro
---
<section class="relative min-h-[90svh] overflow-hidden pt-28 pb-12 sm:pt-32">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/[0.54] dark:bg-[#0D1117]/[0.48]"></div>
    <div class="ambient-glow"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="evolvaer-container relative z-10 flex flex-col justify-between px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] lg:items-center">
      <div>
        <div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-4">
          <span class="h-px w-10 bg-[#2563EB] dark:bg-[#3B82F6]"></span>
          <span class="text-[0.66rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#0A1D2F]/45 dark:text-white/42">About Evolvaer</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-[clamp(2.8rem,5vw,5rem)] font-semibold leading-[0.9] tracking-tight text-[#0A1D2F] dark:text-white">
          Built to explore<br />
          what comes <span class="brand-gradient">next.[cite: 1]</span>
        </h1>
        <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#10B981] shadow-[0_0_16px_rgba(16,185,129,.6)] dark:bg-[#22D3EE]"></span>
          <span class="text-[0.62rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#0A1D2F]/40 dark:text-white/35">Research · Engineering · Venture Building[cite: 1]</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border-l border-[#2563EB]/15 pl-6 dark:border-[#3B82F6]/20 sm:pl-8">
        <p class="text-base leading-8 text-[#0A1D2F]/70 dark:text-white/60 sm:text-lg sm:leading-9">
          Evolvaer Technologies is an emerging technology company that researches, engineers and builds products around ideas with the potential to create meaningful real-world value.[cite: 1]
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#0A1D2F]/50 dark:text-white/40">
          We work across the space between technological possibility and practical usefulness — exploring what is changing, understanding what matters and building what proves worth pursuing.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
          <a href="#system" class="btn-primary">Discover our system ↓</a>
          <a href="/what-we-do" class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#0A1D2F]/60 hover:text-[#2563EB] dark:text-white/50 dark:hover:text-[#60A5FA]">What we do →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 border-t border-[#0A1D2F]/10 pt-5 dark:border-white/10 sm:mt-20">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-8 text-xs font-medium text-[#0A1D2F]/50 dark:text-white/40">
        <div><span class="block text-[0.55rem] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#0A1D2F]/30 dark:text-white/25">Mode</span>Continuous exploration</div>
        <div><span class="block text-[0.55rem] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#0A1D2F]/30 dark:text-white/25">Focus</span>Emerging technology</div>
        <div><span class="block text-[0.55rem] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#0A1D2F]/30 dark:text-white/25">Direction</span>Ideas into impact</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>